# oracle: solvated ubiquitin (examples/amoeba: in.ubiquitin with data.ubiquitin = w119amoeba_ub_cut.data: the 1232-atom ubiquitin of the 9737-atom box, with only the 95 water molecules that have an atom within 2 A of the protein kept, 1517 atoms; amoeba_ubiquitin.prm and amoeba_ubiquitin.key: ewald, pme-grid 15 12 12 (the key's commented alternative, the example uses 60 48 48: the full box took 63 s), pme-order 5, cutoff 7 via the key's vdw-cutoff and taper; bond class2, angle amoeba (in-plane anglep terms), dihedral fourier, improper amoeba (opbend), fix amoeba/pitorsion and fix amoeba/bitorsion with bitorsion.ubiquitin.data). The example's dynamics are not part of this case: the energies of every term (pair epair, the bonded terms ebond, eangle, edihed, eimp, the fix energies f_pit and f_bit, the virial) and the forces at step 0 and after two NVE steps (run 0, then run 2; the example runs 10 steps).
# oracle-inputs: w119amoeba_ub_cut.data w119amoeba_ub.prm w119amoeba_ub.key w119amoeba_ub_bitorsion.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
# Measured with native LAMMPS (black box): thermo max relative error 2.4e-13 (c_virial[6] at step 2, rows 0 to 3), per-atom 2.2e-12 (fy) after the two NVE steps; the engine takes about 5 s
units           real
boundary        p p p
atom_modify     sort 0 0.0
atom_style      amoeba
bond_style      class2
angle_style     amoeba
dihedral_style  fourier
improper_style  amoeba
fix             amtype all property/atom i_amtype ghost yes
fix             extra all property/atom i_amgroup d_redID d_pval ghost yes
fix             extra2 all property/atom i_polaxe d2_xyzaxis 3
fix             pit all amoeba/pitorsion
fix_modify      pit energy yes
fix             bit all amoeba/bitorsion w119amoeba_ub_bitorsion.data
fix_modify      bit energy yes
read_data       w119amoeba_ub_cut.data fix amtype NULL "Tinker Types" &
                fix pit "pitorsion types" "PiTorsion Coeffs" &
                fix pit pitorsions PiTorsions &
                fix bit bitorsions BiTorsions
pair_style      amoeba
pair_coeff      * * w119amoeba_ub.prm w119amoeba_ub.key
special_bonds   lj/coul 0.5 0.5 0.5 one/five yes
compute         virial all pressure NULL virial
thermo_style    custom step temp epair ebond eangle edihed eimp emol etotal press f_pit f_bit c_virial[1] c_virial[2] c_virial[3] c_virial[4] c_virial[5] c_virial[6]
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
fix             1 all nve
thermo          1
run             0
run             2
